<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="INA1">
<l>pūmaṉṉu mātu poruntiya mārpaṉ pukaḻmalinta</l>
<l>pāmaṉṉu māṟa ṉaṭipaṇin tuyntavaṉ palkalaiyōr</l>
<l>tāmmaṉṉa vanta virāmā ṉucaṉcara ṇāravinta</l>
<l>nāmmaṉṉi vāḻaneñ cēcollu vōmavaḷāmaṅkaḷē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>So that we live permanently at the lotus-like feet of Rāmānuja,</l>
<l>who came so that men of the many arts and sciences remained,</l>
<l>who, having humbled [himself at] the feet of Māṟaṉ,</l>
<l rend="indent">who endures [in his] songs filled with the glory of Him</l>
<l rend="indent">with the chest that is fit for the woman</l>
<l rend="indent">who abides on the [lotus] flower,</l>
<l>obtained bliss,</l>
<l rend="indent">O heart, we shall speak his names!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
